+- Entity data model: `entities` (soft deletes, routed by `slug`) and `entity_memberships` (role `owner`/`admin`/`employee`, one owner per entity enforced by a generated `owner_seq` column and unique index), `Entity`/`EntityMembership` models, `UserRole` enum, factories, and `EntityPolicy`/`EntityMembershipPolicy`.
